  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Tong Its. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Tong Its is a popular Rummy-style game from the Philippines for three players. It involves drawing, melding sets/runs, and discarding. Players aim to empty their hands ('Tong Its') or minimize points. It features a mechanism to 'Draw' (fight) where players compare scores to end the hand early.",
    objective: 'Empty hand (Tong Its) or have lowest points when Draw is called/deck runs out.',
    gameplay: "1. Draw (from Stock or Discard if meldable). 2. Meld (Bahay) optional. 3. Sapaw (Lay off) on others' melds. 4. Discard. Winning: 'Tong Its' (0 cards). 'Draw' (Call comparison). Stack run out.",
    keyRules: [
      'Sapaw (laying off) is key',
      'Cannot call Draw if Sapawed recently',
      'Burned (Sunog) if no melds open',
    ],
